  "title": "Adverbs (1): 再 vs 又, 终于, 差点, 原来, 一下子, 正好",
  "description": "Again (future vs past), finally, almost (but not), so it turns out, all at once, and just right.",
  "level": "B1",
  "points": [
    {
      "id": "zai_you",
      "title": "再 vs 又: again",
      "summary": "再 (zài) = again **in the future / not yet happened** (再说一遍, 明天再来). 又 (yòu) = again **already happened** (又迟到了).",
      "body": "- 我明天想**再**看一次.\n- 他今天**又**迟到了.",
      "examples": [
        [
          "{请|qǐng}{再|zài}{说|shuō}{一|yí}{遍|biàn}。",
          "Please say it again."
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "zhongyu",
      "title": "终于 … 了: finally",
      "summary": "终于 (zhōngyú) + verb + 了 = finally, after a long wait or effort.",
      "body": "- 等了一个小时，公共汽车**终于**来**了**.",
      "examples": [
        [
          "{我|wǒ}{终于|zhōngyú}{找|zhǎo}{到|dào}{工作|gōngzuò}{了|le}。",
          "I've finally found a job."
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "chadian",
      "title": "差点(儿): almost (but didn't)",
      "summary": "差点(儿) (chàdiǎnr) + verb = it almost happened — but in the end it didn't.",
      "body": "- 路上车太多，我**差点**迟到了.\n- 我**差点儿**忘了 (I almost forgot).",
      "examples": [
        [
          "{我|wǒ}{差点儿|chàdiǎnr}{忘|wàng}{了|le}。",
          "I almost forgot."
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "yuanlai",
      "title": "原来: so it turns out",
      "summary": "原来 (yuánlái) = 'so that's how it is' — discovering the real situation (often after 以为).",
      "body": "- 我以为他是日本人，**原来**他是韩国人.\n- 难怪这么冷，**原来**窗户开着.",
      "examples": [
        [
          "{原来|yuánlái}{他|tā}{是|shì}{韩国人|Hánguórén}。",
          "So it turns out he's Korean."
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "yixiazi",
      "title": "一下子: all at once, suddenly",
      "summary": "一下子 + verb (+ 了) = suddenly / in one go.",
      "body": "- 听到这个消息，她**一下子**哭了.\n- 他**一下子**就吃完了三碗饭.",
      "examples": [
        [
          "{他|tā}{一下子|yíxiàzi}{就|jiù}{吃|chī}{完|wán}{了|le}。",
          "He finished eating in no time."
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "zhenghao",
      "title": "正好: just right, as it happens",
      "summary": "正好 (zhènghǎo) = just at the right moment / just the right size or amount.",
      "body": "- 我正要给你打电话，你**正好**来了.\n- 这件衣服**正好**，不大也不小.",
      "examples": [
